aving aaron hanging quite high up in  the air  the warhammer's signature ability  enables it to use a special type of  titan hardening with which it can create  structures that shoot out of the ground  like this  or even weapons that manifest inside its  hands whilst aaron is suspended in the  air  willy's sister conjures up that iconic  warhammer and attempts to decapitate the  attack titan  but luckily our boy escapes by  destroying a section of the pillar with  his own hardened fists  if i'm being honest about the animation  i'd be lying if i said the warhammer  titan didn't look a bit clunky  the most obvious example of this  clunkiness was later in the episode when  it was falling down  but even during this scene with the  warhammer it just didn't seem that great  to me  my personal take is that i preferred the  design and the style that we saw in the  trailer for season four  but let me know what you guys think  about this in the comment section down  below  anyway the anime gives us an update on  peak and porco who were trapped in this  hole by an unidentified malian soldier  in the last episode  they can hear the sounds of titans  fighting above them but they themselves  were unable to escape  because the place they're in is just way  too cramped to turn into a titan  luckily in the last episode pique was  suspicious of this malian soldier right  from the beginning  and so when she hugged this member of  the panzer unit she secretly told him to  follow them  in case something happened the panzer  team eventually shows up and frees the  two warriors  but the car titan can't join the battle  straight away because she needs to get  suited into her titan armor  on the other hand poco wanted to join  the fight immediately but is taken aback  when he notices people zipping above the  skies of liberio  thanks to the many letters that falco  sent aaron was able to contact the  scouts  who have now arrived to assist him now  if you guys cast your minds back to the  b