 to manually reload  these scouts have semi-automatic pistols  plus the space to equip  spears on top given that there's been a  three year time skip between the end of  season three and the beginning of this  season  obviously a lot of characters have  changed you know physically  and when it comes to mikasa her hair has  gotten significantly shorter  there is actually a funny reason for  this as in an interview two years ago  isayama revealed that mikasa had her  long hair in a ponytail  and accidentally cut the knot which  resulted in what you see before you  this accident where she cuts her  ponytail was never shown in the manga so  it's not actually a spoiler but it's  just a bit of trivia that i remember  reading  after blowing up the warhammer titan's  neck mika said tearfully asked erin to  come back home  and you can just tell by her expression  that she's fed up of erin cosplaying as  a hobo soldier in mali  she's also struggling to accept that  aaron is capable of doing what he did  as you know when you look at the  dialogue even she thinks that he doesn't  realize what he's done  as the scouts continue to wipe out mali  soldiers flock begins to go a little bit  overboard in his destruction  as he wants to maximize the damage to  mali in revenge for what they did to  paradise  this way of thinking is almost identical  to aaron who has destroyed everything he  could so far  and you know what at least they agree on  one thing because the last time we saw  those two interact  they did not see eye to eye jean however  doesn't really agree with maximizing  damage to mali in this way  as he has somewhat of a conscience and  he realizes that there are innocent  civilians who could be hurt  on the main battlefield the warhammer  titan pulls itself back together  and generates a functional crossbow made  from titan hardening which is something  you would have never thought possible  before seeing this titan  i explained this a bit more in a  different video but th