itan  is located near the spot where it first  materialized the thick cable connecting  the crystal  to the titan they didn't try to hide it  or anything like that so aaron can see  this thing  and he knows where to go in his titan  form he grabs the crystal from  underground  and then proceeds to snap the cable in  half the warhammer titan can't function  unless that cable is connected  so it collapses into a lifeless husk  before aaron attempts to eat willy type  his sister  just before this levi makes his first  cameo appearance of the new season  standing on top of the structure that  the warhammer previously used to attack  eren  levi is the only scout who stuck with  his swords instead of bringing a firearm  and this turned out to be a genius  decision based on what happened next  earlier in the episode we saw how poco  was eager to join the fight  and as aaron is about to eat the wahima  titan he finally  arrives sneaking up behind the attack  titan and yeah i guess attempting to  steal the founding titan  the draw titan's mouth is incredibly  powerful so if he actually had time to  take a full bite  then there would be nothing eren could  do to stop it thankfully levi  was able to cut through the muscle of  the draw titan's mouth which prevented  poker from clamping down  what was funny was how terrified poco  was of levi once he realized that this  was the acumen  like judging by the way he was running  away you'd have thought he saw like  another titan shifter or something like  that  not a human being who just has two  swords as he tries to escape the area  the draw titan collapses to the ground  after being hit with a thunderspear  the episode ends on a bit of a  cliffhanger as the soldiers circle  around him in a very intimidating  fashion  and poco looks genuinely shaken in this  moment  just before we end the video i did  really like that opening scene  of how willy was interacting with his  kids i mean to be honest when we saw  them for the first time i didn't  actually think those were his kids  i don't know who i thought they were i  just assumed they were like other family  members but i know it is quite crazy to  see that and i i do like it when the  anime kind of expands  on uh on certain characters more than  what we saw in the manga  let me know what you guys thought about  episode six how would you rate it out of  10 compared to the other episodes  i would personally give it like i reckon  give it like a  7 out of 10 compared to the previous  episodes let me know what you guys think  in the comments down below  and as usual i'd appreciate if you  dropped a like if you like this video  and share it with anyone who you think  might enjoy it thanks for watching and  until the next one  peace out

